{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_title", "source_sha256": "27b2bc8dd85012c8f3d1dcf0b649b70521291a664a5bd92a6275225f8f8d46a3", "ja": "「君と出会ってから」双海真美", "zh": "“与你相遇之后”双海真美", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0d18b829939e3d454d452aa3341a5670ce15503eb44554041112883f4b96b897", "ja": "Destiny公演を前に、\n真美とプロデューサーが出会った頃のことを\n振り返る一幕です。", "zh": "这是在Destiny公演前，\n真美和制作人回顾\n两人初遇时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1000_p", "source_sha256": "60be5d0460e598ef502838229b334730217701ee6fdb181318851f42853d5f48", "ja": "（公演のレッスンのため、真美を現場まで迎えに行った\nのだが、途中で真美が突然降りると言い出して……）", "zh": "（为了公演的排练，我去现场接真美，可途中真美却突然说要下车……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1001_p", "source_sha256": "56a90718212e16df04b37dfe298fbcf9f9ed91cc098718f3332988bef4ba069d", "ja": "真美。もうレッスンの時間だぞ。\nいい加減に帰らないと。", "zh": "真美，已经到排练时间了。\n再不回去可就来不及了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "ff95e465cab2f2a2e97afb4990d0660146062621d041f1b45b1c617ab589853d", "ja": "もうちょい待って、兄ちゃん！\nさっき、このへんに小さいおじさんがいたんだよ！", "zh": "再等一下下嘛，哥！\n刚才这附近有个小小的大叔哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1003_p", "source_sha256": "b837524e10bfff753f79d2e76b86be960e6ebc59cfed0a80c5062fc8e494ce18", "ja": "……なんだって？\n小さい、おじさん……？", "zh": "……你说什么？\n小小的……大叔……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "71ad125af148930494800c73efd3cfbc2558f33d980aa472b829239ef46e140c", "ja": "兄ちゃん知らないの？　捕まえてどっかに飾ったら、\nなんかご利益をくれるっぽい、謎の……何か！", "zh": "哥哥不知道吗？抓住之后找个地方供起来，好像就会给你带来某种福气，神秘的……某种东西！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1005_p", "source_sha256": "766c7c4f647fcb390fa223f08a6256cc31df1c584869f318415b86c9356d84e8", "ja": "（なんて曖昧な……！）", "zh": "（这也太含糊了吧……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "42e1ae02e3efa2fb20da09ce1507942148fc0f4fea13a5a32b368aed9a6f23aa", "ja": "さあさあ、覚悟をきめて出てくるのだ～。\nこの際、小さいおばさんとかでもいいから～。", "zh": "来吧来吧，下定决心出来吧～。\n在这种时候，就算是小大妈也行啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "6e7155168815dfe127a9d0a72b2f76f5ffb32293402313f60c339d233412f8f9", "ja": "出てきてくれたら、お持ち帰りして劇場に飾るよ～。\n代わりに真美を超せくしーにしていいよ～。", "zh": "只要你肯出来，我就把你带回去，摆在剧场里哦～  \n作为交换，可以把真美变得超级性感哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1008_p", "source_sha256": "938681be850260896839545f31ea79d6f5e4d3b366dc665993b3cd5e39bc1b55", "ja": "（ご利益目当てか……）", "zh": "（是冲着灵验来的啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1009_p", "source_sha256": "3b4514db670c991877635b19410563726b611cf9d0b5920601c036e76147b012", "ja": "（……そういえば、真美たちと初めて会ったのも、\nこんな公園だったな。あの時はネコを捕まえてて……）", "zh": "（……说起来，第一次遇到真美她们，也是在这样的公园里呢。那时候她们正在抓猫……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1010_p", "source_sha256": "280feb6cab49f48289dab413e008eb1fbe4751a9803aab6e3999fd008e446a89", "ja": "（最初は、純粋で無邪気な子どもに見えたっけ。\n……最初は）", "zh": "（一开始看起来还是个纯真无邪的孩子来着。……一开始。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1011_se", "source_sha256": "44b9ebfde68451e64837c2c00759d186dae0631e285721ca76599e253560763d", "ja": "ガサッ！", "zh": "窸窣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "462126c0701b88eb4a121b81ae7290140fd746f7aaea007a658ed94c7198b34b", "ja": "うしろかー！\nと思ったら、おっきい兄ちゃんか。ガッカリだよ。", "zh": "原来在后面啊——！……等等，是大哥哥啊。真失望。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2a0b07750aa33f12384fbf0bfca752bea7a71d212b57b8be0693492976da1af4", "ja": "ガッカリするんじゃない。あと特に大きくもない。\n……で、気が済んだか？", "zh": "别失望，也没那么大。\n……这下满意了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "10e723cea39c639ca603b6230db057b2195bb6665c29f06abdd031e2d4abd2ab", "ja": "済むわけないっしょ？　絶対このへんにいたのに～。\n……ま、いっかぁ。", "zh": "怎么可能满足嘛？明明绝对就在这附近的～  \n……嘛，也就这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "fe1eac1fa55c068b156ff4ed3316b1047305a8b68a7c9610f3e1bba7209c7bac", "ja": "こうなったら、小さいおじさんの代わりに\nおっきい兄ちゃんが真美にご利益ちょうだい！", "zh": "既然这样，就让大哥哥代替小大叔，给真美赐点福吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a93784c88189fd22f92c7ca571b87fbe6f6fcec948d709aedcbe1059fa06f64a", "ja": "なんでそうなるんだ。\nそもそも、そんな神通力はもってないぞ？", "zh": "怎么会变成这样。\n说到底，我可没有那种神通力啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1017_012mam", "source_sha256": "3b26cdb4b00cae37c719b04910ee3ee8c357c7fb78086d5ccdc49384b18e718c", "ja": "えっ……赤ちゃん産むときの？", "zh": "诶……是生小宝宝的时候那种？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1018_p", "source_sha256": "036f13591440f5fb94e0ac995a7127bf42969d4b7a3cc22ba2e5e1175e10dbd3", "ja": "それは陣痛だな……それも知らないが。\nえーと、魔法みたいな力はないってこと。", "zh": "那是阵痛啊……这个我也不知道。\n呃，也就是说，没有什么魔法般的力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1019_012mam", "source_sha256": "101d7454a5554b6fec7272f0ee95795368529c989e204ea3a0c25c7360508475", "ja": "えー、そんなことないよ。\nだって、兄ちゃんはさー。", "zh": "诶～才不是那样呢。\n因为哥哥他啊——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1020_012mam", "source_sha256": "44df7653897817b7134c11f67bbcca6725404925e9c30932b80a0d8cd1348ef4", "ja": "真美がやってみたいこと、いっぱいやらせてくれるし。\n真美の夢だってかなえてくれるもん。", "zh": "因为哥哥总是让真美去做很多想尝试的事情。\n还会帮真美实现梦想呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1021_012mam", "source_sha256": "b77c19061d01ba7d8c1558bacf9fca3d5f9d8115ea911d2f222e9038b40a8976", "ja": "だから、兄ちゃんは真美の魔法使い！　でしょ？", "zh": "所以，哥哥就是实现真美愿望的魔法师！对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1022_p", "source_sha256": "8fff6011ee127418f09519cd79b904ba6ea0a73c046604aa7595d7c4dcf0402f", "ja": "……。いや。それは真美の力かな。\n夢がかなうのは、本人がかなえたいと思うからだ。", "zh": "……。不，那应该是真美的力量吧。\n梦想能实现，是因为本人想要去实现它。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1023_012mam", "source_sha256": "7c1eb156b5f1cbf91394cb2db2fe382239526ad00baaa63f4403905877b72cfe", "ja": "ううん、兄ちゃんだよ。だって真美、\n兄ちゃんと出会うまで、そんなことできなかったもん。", "zh": "不，是哥哥的功劳。因为在遇到哥哥之前，真美根本做不到那种事嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1025_012mam", "source_sha256": "ec922a30a48ee20e2a5e96c5e545e0f43f1e045ba9a6b814de503de674bad72a", "ja": "他にもいっぱい、真美のこと甘やかしてくれるし。\n今も車で送ってくれてるし。", "zh": "而且还总是宠着真美。现在也开车送真美回去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1026_012mam", "source_sha256": "6a1dc9a1c8d1621a13a585b8d5e00b4c26f6c11ec5ed96ff746ff61d0b60c730", "ja": "真美がおなかすいたら、おやつも買ってくれるし。\n真美が欲しいゲームも、ぜーんぶ買ってくれるし！", "zh": "真美肚子饿了的话，还会给真美买零食。\n真美想要的游戏，也会全部买给真美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1027_p", "source_sha256": "43e27ae3491beea82874ebd94b6b645a9f332bfeddf850cf09e51433d36aef2a", "ja": "まぁ、買わないけどな？", "zh": "不过，我才不会买吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1028_012mam", "source_sha256": "ff62e5bbac8d8c7b8398c768290a3882dd850acdda899e44e022c93bd5856c7d", "ja": "もぉっ、今のはゲーム買いに行く流れっしょ！？\n兄ちゃんはわかってないっ。わかってな伊右衛門だよ！", "zh": "真是的，刚才的气氛明明该去买游戏了吧！？\n哥你根本不懂。不懂得伊右卫门啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1029_p", "source_sha256": "9de88370a9a9858cf8f5a0fffca6c74badc4822965cdb1213eb089312cb0958a", "ja": "何衛門だろうと、\nそれは本人の力でどうにかしてもらうぞ。", "zh": "不管是什么“卫门”，都让本人靠自己的力量想办法吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1030_p", "source_sha256": "7c96e08f0d2fac474a3e8da7496b0ddae6986abf754a7dc6128ff47ffd8b77d0", "ja": "俺に使える魔法があるとしたら……。\n真美をトップアイドルにすること。それだけだ。", "zh": "要说我会用的魔法……就是把真美培养成顶尖偶像。仅此而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1031_012mam", "source_sha256": "3d6b47801f07100f5ed458180ccea6a86fd3dbd70e4371fee7d3c670520054da", "ja": "むー……。まぁ、それなら……、いっか！", "zh": "唔……。嘛，既然这样……那就行啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1032_012mam", "source_sha256": "12dbd385c39e703c6863b8c26ee9ec06348061e274712fcdd6b0c1d6d1970ed8", "ja": "んじゃ、その魔法でいいから約束ね。\n真美を絶対、超スーパーせくしーアイドルにすること！", "zh": "那就用那个魔法也行，约好了哦。一定要把真美变成超级超级性感的偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1033_p", "source_sha256": "24e5d96b4bd45905692429b06bdde870fa10b53e5bf98f741a42230f7ecfdb93", "ja": "なんか言葉が増えてるけど、わかった。\n早速、急いで劇場に戻ろうか。", "zh": "虽然感觉又多了些说法，不过知道了。  \n那我们赶紧回剧场吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0442_story_012mam_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0442_story_012mam_1034_p", "source_sha256": "188f7f1cf2ae629bb80864eec9be658b0b658573543fd918baba2e655cc44ba4", "ja": "Destiny公演に向けて、レッスン追い込みだ！", "zh": "为了Destiny公演，要进行最后的集中特训了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
